        83.2621841430664
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 3.1.1.9 Agreement of TBSTs versus IGRAs in all studies including people",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.67418670654297,
        151.36207580566406,
        98.7621841430664
      ],
      "text": "with active TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        410.46893310546875,
        112.31309509277344,
        426.8489074707031
      ],
      "text": "Safety",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.0998229980469,
        527.0030517578125,
        450.2448425292969
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review of studies reporting the outcomes of interest, including local reactions –",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.5998229980469,
        526.9039916992188,
        465.7448425292969
      ],
      "text": "that is, injection site reactions (ISR) and systemic adverse events from TBSTs – was undertaken.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.0998229980469,
        527.0504150390625,
        481.2448425292969
      ],
      "text": "The following databases were searched for studies from inception until 30 July 2021: Medline,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991296768188477,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        483.5998229980469,
        526.64990234375,
        496.7448425292969
      ],
      "text": "Embase, e-library, the Chinese Biomedical Literature Database and the China National",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        499.0998229980469,
        526.9700927734375,
        512.2448120117188
      ],
      "text": "Knowledge Infrastructure Database. The test manufacturers were contacted for individual",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.599853515625,
        526.96240234375,
        527.744873046875
      ],
      "text": "studies, and studies were identified through a public call for data by WHO. Longitudinal and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.099853515625,
        527.1791381835938,
        543.244873046875
      ],
      "text": "case–control studies reporting adverse events of the index tests alone or compared with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        545.599853515625,
        526.969970703125,
        558.744873046875
      ],
      "text": "recognized comparator tests (e.g. QFT, T-Spot and the TST) in humans were included with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        561.099853515625,
        526.9259033203125,
        574.244873046875
      ],
      "text": "no language restrictions. Screening of titles and abstracts as well as full-text articles and the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.5997924804688,
        526.9810180664062,
        589.7448120117188
      ],
      "text": "assessment of quality were performed by two investigators in duplicate. A meta-analysis was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.0997924804688,
        527.2031860351562,
        605.2448120117188
      ],
      "text": "conducted using a random-effects model, and studies that were considered to be clinically",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.5997924804688,
        203.82179260253906,
        620.7448120117188
      ],
      "text": "homogenous were pooled.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.1038208007812,
        527.0428466796875,
        643.2488403320312
      ],
      "text": "Overall, seven studies for Cy-Tb, five for C-TST and 11 for Diaskintest were identified.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.1038208007812,
        273.0433044433594,
        657.2488403320312
      ],
      "text": "Characteristics of studies were as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.855712890625,
        78.81909942626953,
        677.000732421875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        663.855712890625,
        527.00390625,
        677.000732421875
      ],
      "text": "Cy-Tb: clinical trials – three studies in South Africa and four in Europe. Most participants",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        679.355712890625,
        526.9654541015625,
        692.500732421875
      ],
      "text": "were adults; in studies in South Africa, 20–40% of participants were PLHIV. Five of seven",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        694.855712890625,
        527.240234375,
        708.000732421875
      ],
      "text": "studies included random allocation of Cy-Tb versus the TST into two arms and thus allowed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997550010681152,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        710.355712890625,
        526.96435546875,
        723.500732421875
      ],
      "text": "comparison of ISR. All five studies were included in the pooled evidence assessment on any",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        725.855712890625,
        526.9862670898438,
        739.000732421875
      ],
      "text": "ISR. Only one study provided comparable data on systemic reactions. This study was also",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        741.355712890625,
        409.7544860839844,
        754.500732421875
      ],
      "text": "included in the pooled evidence assessment on systemic reactions.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "132 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
